{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06674","headline":"洛潭送人觐省 · 储光羲","name":"洛潭送人觐省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清洛带芝田，东流入大川。\n舟轻水复急，别望杳如仙。\n细草生春岸，明霞散早天。\n送君唯一曲，当是白华篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06674.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06674","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}